      "start_seconds": 335.73,
      "end_seconds": 356.9,
      "duration_seconds": 21.17,
      "text": "so, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like an anxiety or caffeine-related tremor. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Another possibility is an overactive thyroid. Let's book a thyroid test to look into tremor"
